      "text": "- every circle has an internal color\n- each color belongs to a position in the grid (1-9)\n- if the color is in the exact position for the row AND column the romboid will be green\n- if the color is in the the same row OR column than it should be the romboid will be yellow\n- if does not match row nor column the romboid is empty",
